sequenceDiagram
  actor Harness
  participant Memory as Memory source
  participant Client
  participant Load
  Harness->>Harness: write the rows by hand (a Project, Proposals, Revisions, two human members, one agent, votes)
  Harness->>Memory: create(rows)
  Harness->>Client: connect(source), then project()
  Client->>Memory: fetch(container, exposure)
  Memory-->>Client: rows
  Client->>Load: build and check invariants
  Load-->>Client: load
  Client-->>Harness: Project as of t
  Note over Harness,Load: To add one vote, the harness rewrites the rows and builds a new load
